# REQUIRES: lean
#
# The spec collections in Lean: a sequence is a List Int, a set its
# membership test, a multiset its counts, and a map the value at each key it
# holds, with each operation of <cppverify.h> defined in the prelude, total
# as it is there, and lemmas for each.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %cpp-verify --backend=lean --lean-project=%t/p %S/Inputs/lean_collections.cpp -- 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=EXPORT
# RUN: FileCheck %s --input-file=%t/p/CppVerify/Specs.lean --check-prefix=SPECS
# RUN: FileCheck %s --input-file=%t/p/CppVerify/Prelude.lean --check-prefix=PRELUDE
# RUN: cat %t/p/CppVerify/Goals/cppverify_sets_d46b53.lean %t/p/CppVerify/Goals/cppverify_multisets_68c3c1.lean %t/p/CppVerify/Goals/cppverify_maps_289bf4.lean %t/p/CppVerify/Goals/cppverify_sequences_b14fed.lean | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=GOALS
#
# Each step that revision 2 of cppverify_auto adds proves a goal here first:
# machine equalities as integers (x != y), a collection equality element by
# element, and a definition instance by the body it names.
# RUN: grep -h 'automation:' %t/p/CppVerify/Proofs/cppverify_sets_d46b53/cppverify_sets_d46b53_assertion_a932edd2.lean %t/p/CppVerify/Proofs/cppverify_multisets_68c3c1/cppverify_multisets_68c3c1_assertion_962b234c.lean %t/p/CppVerify/Proofs/cppverify_total_push_cdfd2d/cppverify_total_push_cdfd2d_postcondition_3a9fac6f.lean | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=STEPS
#
# cppverify_auto proves the goals over each kind, those that unfold a spec
# too. A proof by hand may use the lemmas, as this one of total_push does in
# place of the automatic one; the false claim stays unproved.
# RUN: cp %S/Inputs/lean_collections_total_push.lean %t/p/CppVerify/Proofs/cppverify_total_push_cdfd2d/cppverify_total_push_cdfd2d_postcondition_3a9fac6f.lean
# RUN: not %cpp-verify --backend=lean --lean-project=%t/p --lean-certify %S/Inputs/lean_collections.cpp -- 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CERTIFY
#
# The scratch-pad states the same goals.
# RUN: %cpp-verify --backend=lean --lean-out=%t/scratch.lean %S/Inputs/lean_collections.cpp -- 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SCRATCH
# RUN: FileCheck %s --input-file=%t/scratch.lean --check-prefix=SCRATCH-TEXT

# EXPORT: Exported: decreases: total (cppverify_auto proved 1 of 1 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: lean obligation: sequences (cppverify_auto proved 5 of 5 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: lean obligation: sets (cppverify_auto proved 3 of 3 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: lean obligation: multisets (cppverify_auto proved 3 of 3 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: lean obligation: maps (cppverify_auto proved 3 of 3 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: lean obligation: total_push (cppverify_auto proved 2 of 2 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: lean obligation: wrong (cppverify_auto proved 1 of 2 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: decreases: members (cppverify_auto proved 1 of 1 goals)
# EXPORT-NEXT: Exported: lean obligation: no_members (cppverify_auto proved 2 of 2 goals)

